---
---
<section id="outcomes" class="section-padding bg-white">
  <div class="container-custom">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Business Outcomes</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto">What your organization gains with on-premise AI infrastructure.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      <div class="card text-center relative group">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 mx-auto mb-4 rounded-xl bg-green-100 flex items-center justify-center">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-green-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Save Hours on Search</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Instantly find information across thousands of documents, contracts, and emails — no more manual digging.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card text-center relative group">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 mx-auto mb-4 rounded-xl bg-indigo-100 flex items-center justify-center">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-indigo-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Keep Data Private</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Confidential data stays inside your company. No third-party cloud, no data leakage, full control.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card text-center relative group">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 mx-auto mb-4 rounded-xl bg-amber-100 flex items-center justify-center">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-amber-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 8c-1.657 0-3 .895-3 2s1.343 2 3 2 3 .895 3 2-1.343 2-3 2m0-8c1.11 0 2.08.402 2.599 1M12 8V7m0 1v8m0 0v1m0-1c-1.11 0-2.08-.402-2.599-1M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Cut AI Costs</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Eliminate recurring per-seat AI subscriptions. Once deployed, your AI runs at near-zero variable cost.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card text-center relative group">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 mx-auto mb-4 rounded-xl bg-purple-100 flex items-center justify-center">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-purple-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13 7h8m0 0v8m0-8l-8 8-4-4-6 6" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Boost Productivity</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Automate repetitive workflows. Your AI assistant handles document processing, summaries, and routine tasks.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card text-center relative group">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 mx-auto mb-4 rounded-xl bg-teal-100 flex items-center justify-center">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-teal-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.828 10.172a4 4 0 00-5.656 0l-4 4a4 4 0 105.656 5.656l1.102-1.101m-.758-4.899a4 4 0 00-5.656 0l-4 4a4 4 0 005.656 5.656l1.102-1.101m-.758-4.899a4 4 0 00-5.656 0l-4 4a4 4 0 005.656 5.656l1.102-1.101" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Integrate With Your Stack</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">AI that works alongside your existing tools — email, calendar, document storage, and internal apps.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card text-center relative group">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 mx-auto mb-4 rounded-xl bg-red-100 flex items-center justify-center">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-red-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Own Your Infrastructure</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Hardware, models, and data are 100% yours. No vendor lock-in, no hidden fees, no dependency on third parties.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>